WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.130 line:10%
Di dalam setiap gentian otot

2
00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.820 line:10%
terdapat simpanan kalsium,

3
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.720 line:10%
termeterai dalam retikulum sarkoplasma.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.740 line:10%
Apabila gentian teruja, satu isyarat

5
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.920 line:10%
menyusur turun tubul T.

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.650 line:10%
Penderia voltan — reseptor dihidropiridin (DHPR) —

7
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.460 line:10%
merasai cas dan berubah bentuk,

8
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.010 line:10%
membuka pasangannya, reseptor rianodin (RyR1) —

9
00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.230 line:10%
pintu kalsium RS.

10
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.890 line:10%
Kalsium membanjiri sitoplasma,

11
00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.010 line:10%
dan otot mengecut.

12
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:36.370 line:10%
Di sinilah hipertermia malignan menyerang.

13
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:40.790 line:10%
Dengan mutasi reseptor rianodin atau dihidropiridin,

14
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.510 line:10%
anestetik menyekat saluran ini terbuka.

15
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.940 line:10%
Kalsium tidak dapat disingkirkan, jadi otot

16
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.710 line:10%
membakar tenaga tanpa henti —

17
00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:52.130 line:10%
haba, kekejangan, dan CO₂ yang meningkat.

18
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:55.500 line:10%
Dantrolena menyekat reseptor rianodin untuk mematikannya.

19
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.760 line:10%
Biasanya, pam SERCA mengepam kalsium kembali,

20
00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.240 line:10%
otot mengendur,

21
00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.120 line:10%
dan gentian ditetapkan semula.
